  "consumer": "run-biohazard-mightyrod-after-catch-approach completes the missing Biohazard quest on ordinary Mightyrod with args biohazard and unchanged quest-only acceptance, then opens the Underground Pass route gate. Qualification exercises the Scorpion catch-C fault through both real account-parameterized melee and ranged worker CLIs: complete Barcrawl, pass the outpost, catch all three scorpions, complete Scorpion Catcher, reconcile assets, refuse a completed entry and confirm logout. Preserve existing callers. Bigchopper's retained Scorpion consumer requires separate accepted session recovery.",
